## 🔬 Clinical Trial VE vs. Real-World Effectiveness

````carousel
```markdown
# mRNA Potency (Pfizer/Moderna)
- **Phase III VE:** 94-95% (Wild-type)
- **Real-World (Delta):** 91% Infection / 94% Hospitalization
- **Omicron (Boosted):** >90% Protection against severe disease
- **Safety:** Myocarditis risk (12-45/million)
```
<!-- slide -->
```markdown
# Adenoviral Vectors (AZ/J&J)
- **Phase III VE:** 67-70% (Wild-type)
- **Real-World (Delta):** 80-85% Hospitalization
- **Omicron (Boosted):** ~70% Protection
- **Safety:** Rare TTS risk (2-6/million)
```
<!-- slide -->
```markdown
# Recombinant & Inactivated
- **Novavax:** 89.7% VE / 96% Hospitalization
- **Sinovac/Sinopharm:** 50-78% VE / 65-70% Severe RWE
- **Omicron:** Rapid waning without mRNA booster
```
````

